   "title": "Read me",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## A1111 Color Correction (img2img)\n\nAn img2img pass drifts in colour, especially at higher denoise. This is the fix Automatic1111 applies: histogram-match the result to the input image in LAB, then keep the generated image's own brightness.\n\n**Wire the original image into `reference`.** Compare the two previews: the top one is raw, the bottom one corrected.\n\n`blend_mode = a1111` is the webui's exact behaviour. `lab_luminosity` is the opposite trade — it keeps the original colours and takes the corrected brightness."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
